  claim    = {summit and paperkit each hand-rolled a parse of the same artifact within an hour and each got a wrong number — summit's regex over raw files invented two phantom authors that looked exactly like a known tail-parsing bug, paperkit's grep over the same files counted 21 authors where the owning tool reports 17 — and paperkit reproduced the failure after reading summit's report of it.},
